 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Eiyuu Blanc no Jinsei Keikaku Dai Ni no Jinsei wa Akogare no Zatsuyougakari de Onegaishimasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "英雄ブランの人生計画 第二の人生は雑用係でお願いします"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Former Strongest Hero Lives as a Side Character"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Blanc, the most powerful Grade-0 Adventurer, known across the world as the Black Emperor. After slaying the Black Dragon that plunged the world into despair, he became a legendary hero.\n\nAnd then, he made a shocking declaration: “I’m retiring from being a Grade-0 Adventurer.”\n\nNow walking a new path, Blanc—once hailed as the strongest—takes on humble odd jobs as he begins a quiet journey of self-discovery. From Miku, the creator of “The Fruit of Evolution”, comes a bold new fantasy brought to life on an epic scale!"
  },
